            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in ShawNotch 1.7.28</h2>
<ul>
<li>The Dock comes back after Clean Desktop every time. Leaving it straight after it began, or as songs changed, could leave the Dock set to hide itself.</li>
<li>Clipboard history is on from the start when you first install ShawNotch. If you already had it off, it stays off; switch it in Settings → Widgets.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
